    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated just c. 3 km from Nenagh town on the Dublin Road, this three bedroom semi-detached property occupies a generous c. 0.39 Ha (c. 0.96 acre) site.\n\nThe property has been extended to provide additional living space to the front, together with an ensuite bedroom to the rear.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, living room with solid fuel stove, and a reception room, with tiled flooring to these areas. Double doors lead from the living room into the reception room and onwards to the kitchen, which is fitted with an oil-fired range.\n\nTo the rear of the property is a double bedroom together with a fully tiled bathroom.\n\nOn the first floor are two further bedrooms, both of which require refurbishment, offering scope for the new owner to upgrade and modernise the accommodation to their own requirements.\n\nSet on a substantial site of approximately 0.96 acres and within easy reach of Nenagh town, the property offers excellent potential for renovation and further improvement."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.877w x 1.089d\n\n\nLiving Room - 2.721w x 3.342d\n\n\nLiving Room Section 2 - 2.141w x 4.096\nTiled, solid fuel stove\n\nSitting Room - 3.330w x 3.178d\n\n\nKitchen/Dining - 3.7w x 3.411d\nOil fired range\n\nGround floor bedroom - 3.8w x 3.281d\nEnsuite\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.822w x 3.637d\nFully tiled, electric shower\n\nBedroom 2 Upstairs - 3.759w x 3.835d\n\n\nBedroom 3 Upstairs - 2.279w x 3.832d\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Close to Nenagh Town.</li><li> Extended ground floor to include ground floor ensuite bedroom.</li><li> Large Site.</li><li> Services : O.F.C.H., septic tank, mains water, electricity.</li><li> uPVC double glazed windows.</ul>"
      },
